  "label": "Use of religious authority to make political commentary",
  "description": "The meme uses Pope Francis, a religious leader, to make a political statement about Donald Trump. This requires background knowledge that religious figures are often invoked in political discourse, and that using them to make political points can be seen as disrespectful or misleading, especially when misquoting or misrepresenting their views. The meme's intent relies on this dynamic.",
